<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
    <title>SEMC - Main Feed</title>
    
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
    
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="navbar-logo">
            <span class="logo-text">SEMC</span>
        </div>
        <div class="navbar-actions">
            <button class="btn-icon">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">account_circle</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="main-layout">
        
        <aside class="sidebar">
            <a asp-action="Index" asp-controller="Postar" method="post" class="a-cta">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">add</span>
                Create New Post
            </a>
            
            <div class="filter-menu">
                <div class="filter-header">
                    <h2>Filter by Status</h2>
                    <p>Track feedback progress</p>
                </div>
                <nav class="filter-nav">
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="document.querySelectorAll('article').forEach(a => a.style.display = a.innerText.includes('Reported') ? 'flex' : 'none')">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-red">report</span>
                        <span class="filter-label">Reported</span>
                        <span class="badge">12</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="document.querySelectorAll('article').forEach(a => a.style.display = a.innerText.includes('In Progress') ? 'flex' : 'none')">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-yellow">pending_actions</span>
                        <span class="filter-label">In Progress</span>
                        <span class="badge">5</span>
                    </button>
                    <button class="filter-btn" onclick="document.querySelectorAll('article').forEach(a => a.style.display = a.innerText.includes('Resolved') ? 'flex' : 'none')">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-green">check_circle</span>
                        <span class="filter-label">Resolved</span>
                        <span class="badge">28</span>
                    </button>
                </nav>
            </div>
            
            <div class="sidebar-footer">
                <p class="footer-links">
                    <a href="#">About</a>
                    <span class="bullet">•</span>
                    <a href="#">Guidelines</a>
                    <span class="bullet">•</span>
                    <a href="#">Privacy</a>
                </p>
                <p class="copyright">© 2024 SEMC</p>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main class="feed-container">
            
            <div class="mobile-filters">
                <button class="mobile-filter-btn">
                    <span class="dot bg-red"></span> Reported
                </button>
                <button class="mobile-filter-btn">
                    <span class="dot bg-yellow"></span> In Progress
                </button>
                <button class="mobile-filter-btn">
                    <span class="dot bg-green"></span> Resolved
                </button>
            </div>

            <article class="post-card">
                <div class="vote-sidebar">
                    <button class="vote-btn vote-up">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_up</span>
                    </button>
                    <span class="vote-count">245</span>
                    <button class="vote-btn vote-down">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="post-content">
                    <div class="post-header">
                        <div class="post-info">
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <span class="author">u/techstudent99</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>2 hours ago</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>Facilities</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="post-title">Air conditioning broken in Lab 3</h3>
                        </div>
                        <span class="status-pill reported">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">report</span> Reported
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="post-body">
                        The AC in Computer Lab 3 (Building B) has been blowing warm air since yesterday morning. It's getting really uncomfortable for the afternoon programming classes, especially with all the machines running. Can someone from maintenance take a look?
                    </p>
                    <div class="post-actions">
                        <button class="btn-action">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat_bubble</span> 42 Comments
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="post-card">
                <div class="vote-sidebar">
                    <button class="vote-btn vote-up active">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_up</span>
                    </button>
                    <span class="vote-count text-primary">189</span>
                    <button class="vote-btn vote-down">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="post-content">
                    <div class="post-header">
                        <div class="post-info">
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <span class="author">u/library_dweller</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>1 day ago</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>Infrastructure</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="post-title">Request for more power outlets in the main library</h3>
                        </div>
                        <span class="status-pill in-progress">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">pending_actions</span> In Progress
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="post-body">
                        During peak hours, it's impossible to find a spot with a working power outlet on the second floor. Could we get some power strips or additional floor outlets installed in the quiet study zones?
                    </p>
                    <div class="post-actions">
                        <button class="btn-action">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat_bubble</span> 15 Comments
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="post-card status-resolved">
                <div class="vote-sidebar opacity-70">
                    <button class="vote-btn" disabled>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_up</span>
                    </button>
                    <span class="vote-count">312</span>
                    <button class="vote-btn" disabled>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">keyboard_arrow_down</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <div class="post-content">
                    <div class="post-header">
                        <div class="post-info">
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <span class="author">u/hungry_dev</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>3 days ago</span>
                                <span class="bullet">•</span>
                                <span>Cafeteria</span>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="post-title">Cafeteria microwave fixed</h3>
                        </div>
                        <span class="status-pill resolved">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">check_circle</span> Resolved
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="post-body">
                        Just an update for everyone - the left microwave in the main cafeteria area has been replaced with a new unit. Thanks to student services for getting on this quickly!
                    </p>
                    <div class="post-actions">
                        <button class="btn-action">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined">chat_bubble</span> 8 Comments
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <div class="loading-container">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined animate-spin">autorenew</span>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>